            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/homotopy+type+theory"} homotopy type theory
            in
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/proof+assistants"} proof assistants
            such as
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Coq"} Coq
            or
            = succeed "." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Agda"} Agda
            %a{:href => "#Overturev"} Overture.v
          %p An essentially equivalent way to give the definition, due to Paulin-Mohring, is
          %pre
            %code Inductive id {A} (x:A) : A -&gt; Type := idpath : id x x.
