          %h3#definition_using_an_auxiliary_type Definition using an auxiliary type
          %p
            Similar to how the usual binary identity types can be defined using an
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/interval+type"} interval type
            = succeed "," do
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi 𝕀
