          %h3#ReferencesExplicitDefinition Explicit definition
          %p
            The
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/induction+principle"} induction principle
            for identity types (also known as “path induction” or the “
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/J-rule"}> J-rule
            ”) is first stated in
          %ul
            %li#MartinLof75
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Per+Martin-L%C3%B6f"}> Per Martin-Löf
              ,
              = succeed "," do
