              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Mike+Shulman"}> Mike Shulman
                ,
                %em Towards a Third-Generation HOTT Part 2
                (
                %a{:href => "https://www.cmu.edu/dietrich/philosophy/hott/slides/shulman-2022-05-05.pdf"}> slides
