          %h3#polymorphism_and_identity_types_between_types Polymorphism and identity types between types
          %p
            Discussion about
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/polymorphism"} polymorphism
            and identity types between types in a
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/dependent+type+theory+with+type+variables"} dependent type theory with type variables
          %ul
            %li
              %em> Dependent Type Theory vs Polymorphic Type Theory
              , Category Theory Zulip (
